ter:** `wiki-project` writes `wiki/authored/<project>/notes/project-tooling.md` (`kind: note`), creating the project overview first if the project has no wiki entry.\n- **agent-game-studio plugin-map:**\n  - `wiki-search` does read-only page lookup and cited answers.\n  - `wiki-project` writes original documents and the roadmap, and runs required validation of changed pages.\n  - `wiki-setup` handles validation-only requests, whole-vault reports, diagnostics and initialization.\n  - `wiki-researcher` gets no task of its own.\n  - It also names `scripts/session-brief.mjs` (0.73.0 or later) and a 0.55.0 minimum wiki-master version. I did not verify those versions or the script.\n- **agent-unreal JSON:** the block is a name list only, with no semantic task.\n\nOf the five roles in your request (search, original documentation, diagnostics/setup, research, maintenance), only maintenance has no markdown caller.\n\n## Direct references\n\nI opened the first line of each file; all exist in the candidate:\n- `spec-plan/references/spec-template.md`\n- `spec-plan/references/evidence.md`\n- `q-master/references/note-template.md`\n\nMy Glob call was denied, so these are the only references I checked. I did not check the plugin-map's relative links (`process.md`, `adoption.md`, `entry.md`, `vocabulary.md`).",
